    "text": "Bletsia\u00f0 ge ealle weorc drihtnes drihten Benedicite omnia opera domini dominum.\nBletsia\u00f0 heofonas drihten bletsia\u00f0 englas drihtnes drihten Benedicite c\u00e6li dominum benedicite\nBletsia\u00f0 w\u00e6tru \u00fea \u00f0e ofer heofonas sint drihten bletsia\u00f0 ealle m\u00e6gnu drihtnes drihten Benedicite\nBletsia\u00f0 sunne & mona drihten bletsia\u00f0 steorran heofones drihten Benedicite sol et luna dominum\nBletsia\u00f0 scur & deaw drihten bletsia\u00f0 ealle gastas god drihten Benedicite imber et ros dominum\nBletsia\u00f0 fyr & h\u00e6to drihten bletsia\u00f0 nihta & dagas drihten Benedicite ignis et estus dominum\nBletsia\u00fe \u00feeostro & leoht drihten bletsia\u00f0 cyle & h\u00e6tu drihten Benedicite tenebr\u00e6 et lumen dominum\nBletsia\u00fe hrim & snawas drihten bletsia\u00f0 legetu & wolcnu drihten Benedicite pruina et niues\nBletsige eor\u00f0an drihten benedicat terra dominum.\nBletsia\u00f0 muntas & hylla drihten bletsia\u00f0 ealle acennede eor\u00f0an drihten Benedicite montes et colles\nBletsia\u00f0 s\u00e6s & flod drihten bletsia\u00f0 wyllas drihten Benedicite maria et flumina dominum\nBletsia\u00fe hwalas & ealle \u00fea \u00f0e beo\u00f0 onstyrede on w\u00e6terum drihten bletsia\u00f0 fuglas heofones drihten\nBletsia\u00fe wilddeor & ealle nietenu drihten bletsia\u00f0 bearn monna drihten Benedicite besti\u00e6 et\nBletsige drihten benedicat israhel dominum.\nBletsia\u00f0 sacerdhadas drihtnes drihten bletsia\u00f0 \u00feeowas drihtnes drihten Benedicite sacerdotes\nBletsia\u00fe gastas & sawla rihtwisnessa drihten bletsia\u00fe halige & ea\u00f0mode on heortan drihten\nBletsia\u00fe annanias adzarias & missael drihten Benedicite annanias azarias et misahel dominum.\nBletsien we f\u00e6der & sunu & \u00feone halgan gast drihten Benedicamus patrem et filium et spiritum\nHerien we & ofer uphebben we hine on weorulde Laudemus et superexaltemus eum in s\u00e6cula.\nGebletsod \u00feu eart on rodore heofones & hergendlic & wuldorf\u00e6st & ofer upahefen on weorulde\nSwa hwylc swa wille hal beon beforan eallum \u00feingum \u00feearf is so\u00felice \u00fe\u00e6tte he h\u00e6bbe \u00feone\n\u00deone nym\u00fee gehwelc onwealhne & unbesmitenne healde butan tweon on ecnesse forweor\u00f0e\u00f0\nGeleafa so\u00felice se ealleca \u00feis is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nne god on \u00ferienesse & \u00fea \u00f0rienesse on annesse we\nNe ne gemengen we \u00fea hadas ne \u00fea spede asyndrien we Neque confundentes personas neque\nO\u00feer is witodlice had f\u00e6deres o\u00feer is \u00fe\u00e6s suna o\u00f0er is \u00fe\u00e6s halgan gastes Alia est enim persona\nAc \u00fe\u00e6s f\u00e6deres & \u00fe\u00e6s suna & \u00fe\u00e6s halgan gastes an godcundnes is efengelic wuldor efenece\nHwylc hwylc is se f\u00e6der hwylc is se sunu hwylc is & se halga gast Qualis pater talis filius talis et\nUngesceapen & ungeworden is se f\u00e6der ungesceapen is se sunu ungesceapen is & se halga gast\nMycel & unm\u00e6te is se f\u00e6der unm\u00e6te is se sunu micel & unm\u00e6te is & se halga gast Inmensus pater\nEce is se f\u00e6der ece is se sunu ece is & se halga gast Eternus pater \u00e6ternus filius \u00e6ternus et\n& \u00feeah hw\u00e6\u00f0er n\u00e6s na \u00fery ece ac an is ece Et tamen non tres \u00e6terni sed unus \u00e6ternus.\nSwaswa n\u00e6s na \u00feri synt ungesceapene ne \u00ferie unm\u00e6te & healice ac an is ungesceapen &\nGelice is \u00e6lmihtig se f\u00e6der \u00e6lmihtig se sunu \u00e6lmihtig & se halga gast Similiter omnipotens pater\n& \u00feeah hw\u00e6\u00f0ere n\u00e6s na \u00fery \u00e6lmihtige ac an is \u00e6lmihtig Et tamen non tres omnipotentes sed\nSwaswa is god se f\u00e6der god sunu god & se halga gast Ita deus pater deus filius deus et spiritus\n& \u00feeah hw\u00e6\u00f0ere n\u00e6s na \u00fery godas ac an is god Et tamen non tres dii sed unus est deus.\nSwaswa is drihten f\u00e6der drihten sunu drihten & se halga gast Ita dominus pater dominus filius\n& \u00feeah hw\u00e6\u00feere n\u00e6s na \u00ferie drihtnas ac an is drihten Et tamen non tres domini sed unus est\nFor\u00fean swaswa synderlice \u00e6ghwelcne \u00e6nlepne had god & drihten andettan \u00fe\u00e6re cristenan\nSwa \u00ferie godas o\u00f0\u00f0e drihtnas cwe\u00f0an \u00fe\u00e6re eallecan \u00e6wf\u00e6stnesse us is forboden Ita tres deos aut\nF\u00e6der from n\u00e6nigum is geworden ne gesceapen ne acenned Pater a nullo est factus nec creatus\nSunu of f\u00e6der anum is nes na geworden ne gesceapen ac acenned Filius a patre solo est non\nSe halga gast is of f\u00e6der & sunu n\u00e6s na geworden ne gesceapen ne acenned ac for\u00f0cumende\nAn is witodlice f\u00e6der n\u00e6s \u00ferie f\u00e6deras an sunu is n\u00e6s \u00ferie suna an is halig gast n\u00e6s \u00ferie halige\n& on \u00feisse \u00ferienesse nan \u00feing is \u00e6r o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00e6fter nauht is mare o\u00f0\u00f0e l\u00e6sse Et in hac trinitate nihil\nAc ealle \u00ferie hadas efenece him synt & efengelice Sed tot\u00eb tres person\u00eb co\u00e6tern\u00eb sibi sunt et\nSwa swa \u00feurh ealle swaswa eallenge bufan hit gecweden is & seo \u00ferienes on annesse & seo annes\nSe \u00fee wille so\u00felice hal beon swa be \u00fe\u00e6re \u00f0rienesse angite Qui uult ergo saluus esse ita de trinitate\nAc nead\u00feearf is to ecre h\u00e6lo \u00fe\u00e6tte onfl\u00e6scnesse witodlice ures drihtnes h\u00e6lendes cristes\nIs witodlice geleafa se rihta \u00f0\u00e6t we geliefan & andett\u00e6n \u00fe\u00e6tte drihten ure h\u00e6lende crist godes\nGod he is of spede f\u00e6deres \u00e6r weorolde acenned & mann of spede modor on weorold acenned\nFulfremed god & fulfremed mann of sawle gesceadwisre & menniscum fl\u00e6sce gestandende\nGelice is \u00feam f\u00e6der \u00e6fter godcundnesse l\u00e6ssa \u00feam f\u00e6der \u00e6fter menniscnesse Equalis patri\nHe \u00feeah \u00f0e he si god & mann na twegen \u00feeah hwe\u00f0ere ac an crist is Qui licet deus sit et homo\nAn so\u00f0lice n\u00e6s na onwendnesse godcundnesse on fl\u00e6sce onf\u00e6ngennesse \u00fe\u00e6re menniscnesse on\nAn eallunga n\u00e6s na gemengnesse spede ac annesse hades Unus omnino non confusione\nWitodlice swaswa sawl gesceadwis & fl\u00e6sc an mann is swa god & mann an is crist Nam sicut\nHe \u00ferowigende w\u00e6s fro h\u00e6lo ure adune astag to helwarum \u00fey \u00feriddan d\u00e6ge he aras from deadum\nHe upastag to heofonann site\u00fe to swi\u00f0ran healfe godes f\u00e6deres \u00e6lmihtiges \u00feanone toweard is to\nTo \u00fe\u00e6s tocyme ealle men arisan habba\u00f0 mid hira lichaman & agieldende synt be hyra agnum\n& \u00fea \u00f0e good dydon ganga\u00f0 on \u00fe\u00e6t ece lif & \u00fea \u00f0e so\u00felice yfel on \u00fe\u00e6t ece fyr Et qui bona\n\u00deis is se healleca geleafa \u00feone nym\u00fee gehwylc geleaffullice & f\u00e6stlice gelyfe hal ne m\u00e6g beon\n\u00d0e god we herga\u00f0 \u00fee drihten we andetta\u00f0 Te deum laudamus te dominum confitemur.\n\u00dee ecne f\u00e6der eall ear\u00f0e arwur\u00f0ige Te \u00e6ternum patrem omnis terra ueneratur.\n\u00dee ealle englas \u00fee heofonas & ealle andwealdas Tibi omnes angeli tibi c\u00e6li et uniuers\u00e6 potestates.\n\u00dee unablinnendre stefne forecliopia\u00fe Tibi cherubin et seraphin incessabili uoce proclamant.\nHalig halig halig drihten god wereda & folca Sanctus Sanctus Sanctus dominus deus sabaoth.\nFulle sint heofonas & eor\u00f0e m\u00e6gen\u00ferymmes wuldres \u00feine Pleni sunt c\u00e6li et terra maiestatis glori\u00e6\n\u00dee se wuldorf\u00e6ssta apostola \u00fereat Te gloriosus apostolorum chorus.\n\u00dee witgena \u00fe\u00e6t herigendlice get\u00e6l Te prophetarum laudabilis numerus.\n\u00dee martira se sceinnda & se hwita herige \u00fereat Te martyrum candidatus laudat exercitus.\n\u00dee \u00feurh ymbhwyrft eor\u00f0ena seo halige ondette cirice Te per orbem terrarum sancta confitetur\nF\u00e6der \u00f0\u00e6s miclan m\u00e6gen\u00ferymmes Patrem inmens\u00e6 maiestatis.\n\u00de\u00e6re arweor\u00f0an \u00feinne so\u00f0ne & \u00e6nlepne sunu Uenerandum tuum uerum et unicum filium.\nHaligne witodlice \u00f0one tocumendan gast & frofre gast Sanctum quoque paraclitum spiritum.\n\u00deu eart cyning wuldre crist Tu rex glori\u00e6 christe.\n\u00deu f\u00e6der ece \u00f0u ear bearn Tu patris sempiternus es filius.\n\u00deu to alysanne onfenge mon ne onscunedest \u00feu & ne besmite \u00feu f\u00e6mnan inno\u00f0 Tu ad liberandum\n\u00deu oferswi\u00f0dum dea\u00fees sceapnesse \u00feu ontyndest gelyfendum ricu heofona Tu deuicto mortis\n\u00deu to \u00fe\u00e6re swi\u00f0ran healfe godes sitest on wuldre f\u00e6deres Tu ad dexteram dei sedes in gloria\nDema \u00feu eart gelefed beon toweard Iudex crederis esse uenturus.\n\u00dee so\u00f0lice we bidda\u00fe \u00feinum \u00feeowum gehelp \u00f0a \u00fei deorwoer\u00f0an blode \u00feu alysdest Te ergo\n\u00deam ecan do mid halgum \u00feinum wuldre beon lacnimende Eterna fac cum sanctis tuis gloria\nHal do folc \u00fein drihten & bletsa yrfweardnesse \u00feine Saluum fac populum tuum domine et benedic\n& rece hie & upahefe hie o\u00fe on ecnesse Et rege eos et extolle illos usque in \u00e6ternum.\n\u00deurh synderlice dagas we bletsia\u00f0 \u00fee Per singulos dies benedicimus te.\n& ic herige naman \u00feinne on ecnesse & on woruld worulde Et laudamus nomen tuum in \u00e6ternum\nGemendema drihten d\u00e6ge \u00feinum butan synne us gehealdan Dignare domine die isto sine peccato\nGemildsa ure drihten gemiltsa ure Miserere nostri domine miserere nostri.\nGeweor\u00fee mildheortnes \u00fein drihten ofer us \u00fe\u00e6m ilcan gemete we gehihta\u00f0 on \u00fee Fiat\nOn \u00fee drihten ic gehihte ne beo ic geswenced on ecnesse In te domine speraui non confundar in\nGemicla\u00f0 sawl min drihten Magnificat anima mea dominum.\n& gefeh & blissode gast min on god minum \u00feam halwendan o\u00f0\u00f0e minre h\u00e6lo Et exultauit spiritus\nFor\u00fean gelocode ea\u00f0modnesse mennenes his gesih\u00fee so\u00felice henonfor\u00fe eadige me cwe\u00fea\u00f0 ealle\nFor\u00f0on he dyde me \u00fea miclan se mihtig is & halig is nama his Quia fecit mihi magna qui potens\n& mildheortnes his from cynne on cyn andr\u00e6dendum hine Et misericordia eius a progeni\u00e6 in\nDyde mihte on earme his tostencte \u00fea oferhidgan on mode heortan his Fecit potentiam in brachio\nOfdune asette \u00fea mihtigan of setle & upahof \u00fea ea\u00f0modan Deposuit potentes de sede et exaltauit\n\u00dea hingriendan he gefylde mid godum & \u00fea welegan he forlet on idel Esurientes impleuit bonis et\nHe onfeng israel cniht his gemindig mildheortnesse his Suscepit israhel puerum suum recordatus\nSwaswa sprecende he w\u00e6s to urum f\u00e6derum abraham & his s\u00e6de o\u00f0 on weoruld Sicut locutus est\nSie gebletsode drihten god israhel for\u00fean neosode & dyde alysnesse folces his Benedictus dominus\n& ar\u00e6rde horn & streng\u00fee halu us on huse dauides cnihtes his Et erexit cornu salutis nobis in domo\nSwaswa sprecende is \u00feurh mu\u00fe haligra his witgena \u00fea from weorulde sint Sicut locutus est per os\n& alisde us from feondum urum & of handa ealra \u00fea \u00f0e us feodon Et liberauit nos ab inimicis\nTo donne mildheortnesse mid f\u00e6derum urum & gemunan cy\u00f0ness\u00e6 his haligre Ad faciendam\n\u00deone swerigiendan a\u00f0 \u00feonne he swor to habrahame f\u00e6der urum sellende hine us Iusiurandum quod\n\u00de\u00e6tte butan ege of handum feonda ura aliesde we \u00feeowigen him Vt sine timore de manibus\nOn halignesse & rihtwisnesse beforan him eallum dagum urum In sanctitate et iustitia coram ipso\n& \u00feu cniht witga \u00fe\u00e6s heahstan \u00feu bist geciged \u00feu foreg\u00e6st so\u00felice beforan onsine drihten\nTo sellenne wisdom h\u00e6lo folce his on forl\u00e6tnesse synna hyra Ad dandam scientiam salutis plebi\n\u00deurh inno\u00feas mildheortnesse godes ures on \u00f0\u00e6m he neosode us upcumende of heanesse Per\nOnlihtan \u00feisum \u00fea \u00f0e on \u00feeostrum & on dea\u00f0es sceade sitta\u00fe to gereccenne fet ure on weg sibbe\nNu forl\u00e6t \u00feeow \u00feinne drihten \u00e6fter worde \u00feinum on sybbe Nunc dimitte seruum tuum domine\nFor\u00fean gesawon eagan mine h\u00e6lo \u00feine Quia uiderunt oculi mei salutare tuum.\n\u00dea \u00feu gegearwodest beforan onsiene ealra folca Quod preparasti ante faciem omnium populorum.\nLeoht to onwrigennesse \u00feeoda & wuldor folce \u00feinum israel Lumen ad reuelationem gentium et",
